{"3697310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KaijuStory", "steam_appid": 3697310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as either an unstoppable kaiju or a desperate human survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the kaiju, you tear through the city searching for signs of life. As the human, you hide in the ruins, completing objectives while avoiding detection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read your opponent and predict their actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/e3249d6a416676251388b624b67b5072.avif?t=1785396671\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras_big/e3249d6a416676251388b624b67b5072.avif?t=1785396671 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KaijuStory</strong> is a <strong>1v1 asymmetric turn-based strategy game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a role:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a <strong>Kaiju</strong>, hunt your target by tearing the city apart. <br>Or be a <strong>human agent</strong>, race across the map to activate all the weapon towers before it’s too late.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Kaiju</strong> gains information by destroying buildings — the more destruction, the easier it is to track the human.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>human</strong> must move carefully, leaving behind tracks that can reveal their position.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/2595ca99c4992e5297f69dc93f61dba6.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=68 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/d8aea864a30d46a6d509cd20bb39ddd0.poster.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/d8aea864a30d46a6d509cd20bb39ddd0.webm?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/d8aea864a30d46a6d509cd20bb39ddd0.mp4?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kaiju use different abilities to find the human. In this case &quot;finding&quot; means smashing buildings to pieces. The more you smash the easier it will be to find your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/35a995d557af060d2235e681d209faf3.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/15feff38f2b4242468ff1b3711551eba.poster.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/15feff38f2b4242468ff1b3711551eba.webm?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/15feff38f2b4242468ff1b3711551eba.mp4?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the human, reach and activate all  of the weapon towers in the city before the Kaiju finds you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/bd3001d59eb49098780e99914443264d.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/284c1eb7634cd84cdfac7b0309b60d4d.poster.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/284c1eb7634cd84cdfac7b0309b60d4d.webm?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/284c1eb7634cd84cdfac7b0309b60d4d.mp4?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the human travels the city trying to complete their goal, they leave tracks which the Kaiju can see. Be careful and think before you make a move. As the Kaiju keep your eyes open for any signs! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track, predict, and corner your enemy as the Kaiju.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/7cf148967e2ca73ddba4565e2cea1a14.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/105c8e1bb1a546f296264a0ddcf34358.poster.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/105c8e1bb1a546f296264a0ddcf34358.webm?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/105c8e1bb1a546f296264a0ddcf34358.mp4?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Kaiju: <strong>Block</strong> paths, create traps, and control the map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/e19c45ecb3dbf073fe013d55b8722fe9.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/41b3be323505bfa867f9dc2128e9388d.poster.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/41b3be323505bfa867f9dc2128e9388d.webm?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/41b3be323505bfa867f9dc2128e9388d.mp4?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the human: Stay hidden, plan routes, and <strong>use decoys</strong> to mislead your hunter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>KaijuStory</i> is built around reading your opponent, adapting under pressure, and making every decision matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outlast the monster—or become the force that levels the city?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetric 1v1 Online multiplayer gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kaiju or Human, each with a unique experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth vs overwhelming force gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-stakes matches focused on mind games and deduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, replayable competitive rounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/d44f4906e390dae66d8bdee32b1f6138.avif?t=1785396671\" width=1000 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't hesitate to join our Discord to discuss the game or find other players to compete with!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as either an unstoppable kaiju or a desperate human survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the kaiju, you tear through the city searching for signs of life. As the human, you hide in the ruins, completing objectives while avoiding detection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read your opponent and predict their actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/e3249d6a416676251388b624b67b5072.avif?t=1785396671\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras_big/e3249d6a416676251388b624b67b5072.avif?t=1785396671 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KaijuStory</strong> is a <strong>1v1 asymmetric turn-based strategy game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a role:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a <strong>Kaiju</strong>, hunt your target by tearing the city apart. <br>Or be a <strong>human agent</strong>, race across the map to activate all the weapon towers before it’s too late.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Kaiju</strong> gains information by destroying buildings — the more destruction, the easier it is to track the human.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>human</strong> must move carefully, leaving behind tracks that can reveal their position.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/2595ca99c4992e5297f69dc93f61dba6.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=68 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/d8aea864a30d46a6d509cd20bb39ddd0.poster.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/d8aea864a30d46a6d509cd20bb39ddd0.webm?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/d8aea864a30d46a6d509cd20bb39ddd0.mp4?t=1785396671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kaiju use different abilities to find the human. In this case &quot;finding&quot; means smashing buildings to pieces. The more you smash the easier it will be to find your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/35a995d557af060d2235e681d209faf3.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/15feff38f2b4242468ff1b3711551eba.poster.avif?t=1785396671\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/15feff