last the monster—or become the force that levels the city?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetric 1v1 Online multiplayer gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kaiju or Human, each with a unique experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth vs overwhelming force gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-stakes matches focused on mind games and deduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, replayable competitive rounds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/extras/d44f4906e390dae66d8bdee32b1f6138.avif?t=1785396671\" width=1000 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't hesitate to join our Discord to discuss the game or find other players to compete with!</p>", "short_description": "A 1v1 asymmetric hunt between a giant kaiju and a lone human in a fully destructible city. One player destroys the city to find their prey—the other survives through stealth and deception.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/080b45904c79b9f5dbbbb63584ecb1c94cbb3e24/header.jpg?t=1785396671", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/cdeccbe81fff85f60714d788ff78c44c9e1c5fe5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785396671", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697310/cdeccbe81fff85f60714d788ff78c44c9e1c5fe5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785396671", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><st